08. Refused: no serviceInformation, no serviceName, 'input' instead of inputSchema, a mode that is neither, an entities member without type - 400 each
======================================================================================================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 210

{
  "detail": "a Service Registration needs 'serviceInformation': an object naming the service",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}

HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 171

{
  "detail": "serviceInformation needs a 'serviceName'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}

HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 222

{
  "detail": "serviceInformation: 'input' - a service's JSON Schemas are 'inputSchema' and 'outputSchema'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}

HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 196

{
  "detail": "serviceInformation: 'mode' is \"synchronous\" or \"asynchronous\"",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}

HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 168

{
  "detail": "a member of 'entities' needs a 'type'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



